, and antique rakodis for timeless grace.'),(12,'Kids Jewellery','prod-b0121-main.jpg',1,0,'2026-09-21 06:43:36','2026-09-21 06:43:36',NULL,'Skin-friendly, lightweight, hypoallergenic jewellery crafted lovingly for little ones.'),(13,'Men\'s Jewellery','prod-b0145-main.jpg',1,0,'2026-09-21 06:43:36','2026-09-21 06:43:36',NULL,'Dignified, heavy-link microplated bracelets and chains designed for contemporary men.');
